      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "the last point is why this wouldn't be practical: anyone could mark an asset they downloaded or purchased somewhere else that has permissive usage rights as something restricted. really, you can't validate that the person uploading is the only person or even a person with rights to use that avatar, so you can't make any judgements based on that or what comes after.",
