  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-01-05T11:43:35.148Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "There are users in VRC, such as myself, who create their own original models and use them only for themselves, without distributing them to others.\n\nBy comparing data such as mesh vertex positions, UV coordinates, weight distribution, bone hierarchy, etc., it may be possible to calculate how similar one avatar is to another.\n\nIf there are other models which have similarity value greater than a threshold, it is considered stolen except for the oldest uploaded one.\n\nIf the model creators do not intend to distribute the model and use it only for themselves, they can activate this protection at the time of the first upload.\n\nThis protection system would be effective in preventing such \"original and completely for personal use\" models from being used by someone who has obtained them illegally.\n\nHowever, it may not be useful for the users who upload and play with same model data obtained/purchased from others in a legitimate way.",
